{"appid": 2097570, "gama": {"steamId": 2097570, "id": 2097570, "name": "StarVaders", "copiesSold": 186861, "unreleased": false, "earlyAccess": false, "firstReleaseDate": 1745971200000, "releaseDate": 1745971200000, "price": 24.99, "developers": ["Pengonauts"], "publishers": ["Joystick Ventures", "Beep Japan"], "publisherClass": "Indie", "reviewScore": 97, "genres": ["Adventure", "Indie", "Strategy"], "tags": ["Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Deckbuilding", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Roguelite", "Difficult", "Visual Novel", "Card Game", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Roguelike", "Board Game", "Female Protagonist", "Card Battler", "Strategy", "2D", "Mechs", "Retro", "Cute", "Turn-Based Combat", "Anime", "Colorful"]}, "store": {"type": "game", "name": "星之侵略者", "steam_appid": 2097570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3631030, 3632550], "detailed_description": "<h1>玩法特色</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/4d4e981cbc3f9f76e8ea98493d331aac.avif?t=1791382526\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从 <strong>400 多张</strong>独特的卡牌和神器中，打造终极卡组！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 款</strong>强大的机甲任您选择，每款机甲都拥有截然不同的玩法和机制。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >掌握 <strong>10 位</strong>风格各异的飞行员，每位都拥有<strong>完全独立</strong>的卡牌、机制和背景！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >使用时空令牌<strong>回溯时间</strong>、纠正错误或完成完美连击。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在多段剧情战役中奋战，揭开神秘的结局！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >难度递增、每日挑战和挑战模式，带来<strong>无限的可玩性</strong>。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >清晰直观的设计——无需冗长的教程，无需查阅 Wiki，只需<strong>纯粹的战术卡组构建</strong>。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/cd0fa1196978c1c1058cf732a899dac4.avif?t=1791382526\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p></p><br><h1>关于游戏</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《星之侵略者》的灵感来源于《杀戮尖塔》、《陷阵之志》等超棒肉鸽卡牌游戏。运用机甲、驾驶员、卡组、神器、地形、怪物属性等不同元素相结合，带来深度有趣的卡牌游戏体验。如果您喜欢《杀戮尖塔》、《陷阵之志》等卡牌游戏，相信您不会失望。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>超多选择，超多机制，藏在手绘风格下的超深度肉鸽卡牌游戏！</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >目前阶段，游戏中已经有3种机甲，10个驾驶员，每一个都有完全不同的卡组配备与作战模式！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/4af4b0aca7c2b087735f8268329ee76b.poster.avif?t=1791382526\" width=800 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/4af4b0aca7c2b087735f8268329ee76b.webm?t=1791382526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/4af4b0aca7c2b087735f8268329ee76b.mp4?t=1791382526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>根据战场随时改变你的策略!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >合理利用战局形势，你的每个抉择都至关重要，善用卡牌，读懂地形，熟悉敌人，才能百战百胜！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/a9d872993ec5009489263a68c01b9158.poster.avif?t=1791382526\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/a9d872993ec5009489263a68c01b9158.webm?t=1791382526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/a9d872993ec5009489263a68c01b9158.mp4?t=1791382526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>强大的后援! 搜刮战利品与神器增强你的卡组！</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >解锁更多令人兴奋的新卡牌、颠覆性的升级和强大的新武器为你的机械人提供动力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/c2808d6e8f1b58d24ac22427c1b4b13e.poster.avif?t=1791382526\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/c2808d6e8f1b58d24ac22427c1b4b13e.webm?t=1791382526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/c2808d6e8f1b58d24ac22427c1b4b13e.mp4?t=1791382526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/213581e2f5de83711c905f5bef309e27.poster.avif?t=1791382526\" width=800 height=670 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/213581e2f5de83711c905f5bef309e27.webm?t=1791382526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/213581e2f5de83711c905f5bef309e27.mp4?t=1791382526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这只是冰山一角，游戏中的神器与卡牌数量组合超多哦！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>希望您玩得开心，能够喜爱这款游戏！</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >现如果喜欢，请您将《星之侵略者》》加入您的愿望单，这对我们很重要。我们自信如果您试玩《星之侵略者》您一定会喜欢这款游戏。感谢您的支持！希望得到您的喜爱。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097570/extras/138a03783c44647b53127132e053cf28.avif?t=1791382526\" width=600 